{"ordinal":16303,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451742179331","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Ears_DontShoot_0fb7423","source":"Firefighter: Когда огонь ревёт вокруг, ты понимаешь, как дорога эта тишина. Кх-кх, ушам теперь всё равно, а вот душе -- ещё нет.","target":"Firefighter: Când focul vuiește în jur, înțelegi cât de prețioasă e liniștea. Cof-cof, urechilor nu le mai pasă, dar sufletului încă da.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16304,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451742179330","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Photo_DontShoot_0f005a9","source":"Firefighter: Только память в огне не горит, а тело – дело времени.","target":"Firefighter: Doar amintirile nu ard în foc, iar trupul... e doar o chestiune de timp.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16305,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451742179329","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Armpit_DontShoot_01c9ded","source":"Firefighter: Иногда просыпаюсь ночью и чувствую, как кожа буквально лопается. Пытаюсь её смазать чем-то, но толку мало. Всё огонь забрал...","target":"Firefighter: Uneori mă trezesc noaptea și simt cum pielea îmi crapă de-a dreptul. Încerc s-o ung cu ceva, dar nu prea ajută. Focul a luat totul...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16306,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451742179328","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Eyes_DontShoot_0aba274","source":"Firefighter: Когда лес горит, кх-кх… Ты просто смотришь, как он превращается в пепел. И понимаешь, что ничего не можешь сделать.","target":"Firefighter: Când arde pădurea, cof-cof… nu poți decât să te uiți cum se preface în cenușă. Și înțelegi că nu poți face nimic.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16307,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451737985033","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Death_02cabd2","source":"Firefighter: Что ж, пора на покой.","target":"Firefighter: Ei bine, a venit vremea să mă odihnesc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16308,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451737985032","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Death_09d8604","source":"Firefighter: Вот оно как…","target":"Firefighter: Așa stau lucrurile…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16309,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451737985031","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Hands_DontShoot_095ba6a","source":"Firefighter: Этими руками, кх-кх, я когда-то спасал людей. А теперь даже кружку нормально держать не могу.","target":"Firefighter: Cu mâinile astea, cof-cof, am salvat cândva oameni. Acum nu mai pot ține bine nici o cană.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16310,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451737985030","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Teeth_DontShoot_038f541","source":"Firefighter: Знаешь, кх-кх, так и не смог приучить детей зубы каждый день чистить. А теперь… Теперь некому напоминать.","target":"Firefighter: Știi, cof-cof, n-am reușit niciodată să-i obișnuiesc pe copii să se spele pe dinți zilnic. Iar acum… acum nu mai are cine să le amintească.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16311,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451737985029","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Ears_Gun_00f3b33","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16312,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451737985028","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Ears_Gun_063c1ce","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16313,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451737985027","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Ears_Gun_094cba0","source":"Firefighter: Всё горит… может, и моя очередь настала.","target":"Firefighter: Arde totul… poate mi-a venit și mie rândul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16314,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451737985026","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Photo_Gun_04e4bc9","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16315,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451737985025","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Photo_Gun_0ec5a81","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16316,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451737985024","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Photo_Gun_0fb8f7d","source":"Firefighter: Если это фото — приговор, кх-кх, давай закончим. Меня уже ничего не удерживает.","target":"Firefighter: Dacă fotografia asta e o sentință, cof-cof, hai să terminăm. Nimic nu mă mai ține aici.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
