{"ordinal":16318,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451733790728","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Armpit_Gun_0315f92","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
