{"ordinal":16324,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451733790722","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Hands_Gun_078d642","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16325,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451733790721","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Hands_Gun_0d1f450","source":"Firefighter: Ну что, мне уже ничего не страшно. Стреляй, если так легче станет.","target":"Firefighter: Ei, mie nu-mi mai e frică de nimic. Trage, dacă așa o să-ți fie mai ușor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16326,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451733790720","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Teeth_Gun_0885c6b","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
