{"ordinal":16336,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451729596417","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Photo_01ba045","source":"Firefighter: Да, конечно. Сейчас получится лесной обугленный труп, так всегда.","target":"Firefighter: Da, sigur. O să iasă un cadavru carbonizat din pădure, ca de obicei.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
