{"ordinal":16340,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451725402120","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Firefighter_Armpit_0412a37","source":"Firefighter: Ты уверен? Это зрелище не из приятных.","target":"Firefighter: Ești sigur? Nu-i o priveliște plăcută.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-407.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
